<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX index closes 2.8 pts lower at 1,016.5.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX index closes 2.8 pts lower at 1,016.5.</headline>
<text>
<p>1215 GMT - Czech RPIX index of 11 share issues continuously traded on the Prague Stock Exchange closes session slightly lower as six of the index components lose ground.</p>
<p>* RPIX down 2.8 points, 0.28 percent, at 1,016.5 points.</p>
<p>* Skoda rises 25 crowns to 965.</p>
<p>* CEZ down six crowns to 895.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom up 15 to 3,415 crowns.</p>
<p>* IPB falls four crowns to 254.</p>
<p>* Five issues rise, six issues fall.</p>
<p>* Turnover 25 million crowns.</p>
<p>-- Jan Lopatka, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
